description: Accessibility constraints for the Rice SIAM website
alwaysApply: true
---

# Accessibility

- Keep the skip link, landmarks (`header`, `nav`, `main`, `footer`), and one meaningful `h1` per page.
- Maintain logical heading order, full keyboard access, and a visible focus indicator.
- Mark the current page with `aria-current="page"`.
- Escape must close the mobile menu and restore focus.
- No hover-only interaction, autoplay, carousels, or background video.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` and `prefers-contrast`.
- Link text must make sense out of context. Informative images need alt text; decorative images use empty alt.
- Event date, time, and location must remain understandable without color or icons.
- `npm run test:a11y` must keep passing. Axe passing is not WCAG certification.
- Manual review in `docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md` is required before mapping `siam.rice.edu`.
